---

---

<section id="about" class="py-20 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-purple-50/50 -z-10"></div>

  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-purple-900 mb-4">
        ¿Quiénes Somos?
      </h2>
      <div
        class="w-24 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-blue-500 mx-auto"
      >
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center mb-20">
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-800 leading-relaxed font-medium">
        Somos una Organización de Investigación por Contrato enfocada en
        conducir y coordinar estudios de
        <span class="font-bold text-purple-700"
          >Bioequivalencia / Biodisponibilidad</span
        >
        y <span class="font-bold text-purple-700"
          >Ensayos Clínicos Fase I, II, III y IV</span
        >.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto relative">
      <div
        class="absolute left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 h-full w-1 bg-purple-200 hidden md:block"
      >
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-12">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8 relative z-10">
          <div
            class="flex-shrink-0 w-32 h-32 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-700 to-blue-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-xl border-4 border-white"
          >
            <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">2009</span>
          </div>

          <div
            class="flex-1 bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-purple-100 hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1"
          >
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-purple-800 mb-2">Fundación</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              El Dr. Héctor Manuel González Martínez fundó UNEBI con la visión
              de proporcionar un servicio integral para la conducción de
              Estudios Clínicos.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="flex flex-col md:flex-row-reverse items-center gap-8 relative z-10"
        >
          <div
            class="flex-shrink-0 w-32 h-32 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-700 to-blue-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-xl border-4 border-white"
          >
            <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">2011</span>
          </div>
          <div
            class="flex-1 bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-purple-100 hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 text-right md:text-left"
          >
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-purple-800 mb-2">
              Autorización COFEPRIS
            </h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              Obtuvimos la autorización para realizar estudios de
              intercambiabilidad por parte de la COFEPRIS.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8 relative z-10">
          <div
            class="flex-shrink-0 w-32 h-32 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-700 to-blue-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-xl border-4 border-white"
          >
            <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">2016</span>
          </div>
          <div
            class="flex-1 bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-purple-100 hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1"
          >
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-purple-800 mb-2">
              Nuevas Instalaciones
            </h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              Inauguración de instalaciones modernas en zona céntrica de
              Guadalajara, duplicando nuestra capacidad.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="flex flex-col md:flex-row-reverse items-center gap-8 relative z-10"
        >
          <div
            class="flex-shrink-0 w-32 h-32 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-700 to-blue-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-xl border-4 border-white"
          >
            <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">2018</span>
          </div>
          <div
            class="flex-1 bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-purple-100 hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 text-right md:text-left"
          >
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-purple-800 mb-2">
              Expansión de Servicios
            </h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              Coordinación de Ensayos Clínicos Fase I-IV y alianzas estratégicas
              con hospitales y especialistas.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8 relative z-10">
          <div
            class="flex-shrink-0 w-32 h-32 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-700 to-blue-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-xl border-4 border-white"
          >
            <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">2020</span>
          </div>
          <div
            class="flex-1 bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-purple-100 hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1"
          >
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-purple-800 mb-2">
              Remodelación
            </h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              Expansión de capacidad instalada para mayor comodidad y seguridad
              de nuestros voluntarios.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-24 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-800 to-indigo-900 rounded-3xl p-12 text-center shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden"
    >
      <div
        class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-white opacity-5 rounded-full -mr-20 -mt-20"
      >
      </div>
      <div
        class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-40 h-40 bg-white opacity-5 rounded-full -ml-10 -mb-10"
      >
      </div>

      <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-6 relative z-10">
        Nuestro Compromiso
      </h3>
      <p
        class="text-xl text-purple-100 leading-relaxed relative z-10 font-light"
      >
        "Proporcionar servicios de <span class="text-white font-bold"
          >calidad, confianza y velocidad</span
        > para acreditar la seguridad y eficacia de productos de salud."
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
